  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing e-governmen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enhance public service delivery and reduce time and costs of citizens and businesses when interacting with public bodies. The project will extend the offer of available e-services on the national portal for citizens and businesses, and will improve the delivery and quality of public services both to citizens and to business. The contract will also digitalise a number of public registries.</narrative>
  </description>
